# vd1 (7x9, x -2..4, y -3..5): ML UP 2 by the column-0 elevator (E1 (0,4), E2 (0,5)), C DOWN 2 by
# the column-1 elevator below (E1c (1,-2), E2c (1,-3)): the two elevators sit on opposite sides, so
# neither side is split twice. TL left (-2,2); TM up (1,4); TR up (2,4); MR + BR right ((4,1) with
# (4,0) right below it: one input fires both by QC); BL down (0,-2); BM down then right ((3,-1)).
design designs/piston-door-3x3/tracks/frame/ff/vd1-ff.txt
